HARVEST HARVESTING AUTOHARVEST

HARVEST

Survey first, equip the appropriate harvesting tool, then type harvest.
Use autoharvest to repeat attempts until the node is exhausted.

  harvest cancel
  harvest stop

Either command immediately cancels the current harvest and stops its repeat
loop. The canceled attempt gives no materials, motes or experience and does
not consume the node. Earlier completed harvests are kept. Your autoharvest
preference is retained for the next time you deliberately start harvesting.

See also: CRAFTING, SURVEY
